---
title: The research is the distribution
date: 2026-04-11
---

CFA plus code is not a SKU. A sales funnel needs a single tagline, and some
profiles don't have one --- not because they're unfocused, but because the
product is the *thinking*, and thinking doesn't compress into a tagline
without lying.

The move is to invert the funnel. Each option you might pursue is a topic to
become known for, not a business to build upfront. Research it. Publish about
it. Distribute to people who care. The essay attracts inbound, deepens the
inventory of who reads you, builds the credential. The service emerges from
the matches.

The writing is the salon. The responses build the inventory. The brokerage
produces the work.
